#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:3
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor is organized around local checkpoint inspection, "
"planning, transformation, export, and validation. The architecture is "
"intentionally bounded. It prepares artifact directories, then leaves "
"runtime qualification to inference frameworks and hardware-specific "
"tests."
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 围绕本地 checkpoint 检查、规划、转换、导出和验证组织。其架构有意保持边界清晰。它负责准备构件目录，然后将运行时资格验证交给推理框架和硬件特定测试。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:5
msgid "Main components"
msgstr "主要组件"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "CLI"
msgstr "CLI"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "parses `convert`, `quantize`, `inspect`, and `validate` commands"
msgstr "解析 `convert`、`quantize`、`inspect` 和 `validate` 命令"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "inspection"
msgstr "检查"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "reads model config, shard index, tensor names, shapes, and source formats"
msgstr "读取模型配置、分片索引、张量名称、形状和源格式"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "planning"
msgstr "规划"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "resolves selectors, exclusions, methods, strategies, and output schemes"
msgstr "解析选择器、排除项、方法、策略和输出方案"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "conversion"
msgstr "转换"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "converts recognized MXFP4 and block FP8 weights to BF16"
msgstr "将可识别的 MXFP4 和块 FP8 权重转换为 BF16"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "quantization"
msgstr "量化"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "applies MSE, GPTQ, AWQ, or AutoRound workflows to selected weights"
msgstr "将 MSE、GPTQ、AWQ 或 AutoRound 工作流应用到选中的权重"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "export"
msgstr "导出"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid ""
"writes shards, indices, quantization config, manifests, reports, and "
"tokenizer files"
msgstr "写入分片、索引、量化配置、清单、报告和 tokenizer 文件"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "validation"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md
msgid "checks generated directory structure and metadata consistency"
msgstr "检查生成的目录结构和元数据一致性"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:17
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "数据流"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:28
msgid ""
"The source directory is treated as read-only during normal operation. "
"Output is written to a separate directory."
msgstr "正常运行期间源目录按只读处理。输出会写入单独的目录。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:30
msgid "Command responsibilities"
msgstr "命令职责"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:32
msgid "`inspect`"
msgstr "`inspect`"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:33
msgid "Reports supported source formats and selectable weight groups."
msgstr "报告受支持的源格式和可选择的权重组。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:35
msgid "`convert`"
msgstr "`convert`"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:36
msgid "Converts recognized FP4 or FP8 checkpoint weights to BF16."
msgstr "将可识别的 FP4 或 FP8 checkpoint 权重转换为 BF16。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:38
msgid "`quantize`"
msgstr "`quantize`"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:39
msgid "Quantizes selected weights and exports the requested ABI."
msgstr "量化选中的权重并导出请求的 ABI。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:41
msgid "`validate`"
msgstr "`validate`"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:42
msgid "Validates a converted or quantized output directory."
msgstr "验证已转换或已量化的输出目录。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:44
msgid "Boundary with runtime frameworks"
msgstr "与运行时框架的边界"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:46
msgid ""
"The architecture does not include inference serving. Runtime frameworks "
"such as [vLLM](https://docs.vllm.ai/) read the generated artifact after "
"FlagOS-Compressor has finished."
msgstr "该架构不包括推理服务。FlagOS-Compressor 完成后，诸如 [vLLM](https://docs.vllm.ai/) 之类的运行时框架会读取生成的构件。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:48
msgid ""
"That boundary is important because a structurally valid artifact can "
"still fail runtime loading when:"
msgstr "这条边界很重要，因为结构有效的构件在以下情况下仍可能无法在运行时加载："

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:50
msgid "the framework does not support the declared quantization scheme."
msgstr "框架不支持声明的量化方案。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:51
msgid "the accelerator lacks matching kernels."
msgstr "加速器缺少匹配的内核。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:52
msgid "tensor parallel settings are invalid."
msgstr "张量并行设置无效。"

#: ../../source/explanation/architecture.md:53
msgid "runtime memory overhead exceeds available capacity."
msgstr "运行时内存开销超过可用容量。"
